    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if it's temporary though. it just feels like the part of me that actually mattered is just... gone. like the soul of it. everything else is just noise and chores and trying to pretend i'm still here. it's so exhausting to keep up the act of being a person when there's nothing left inside to drive it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
